# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# NOTE: _redirects matches on PATH, not hostname, so it cannot send
# www.theclinicalbench.com to theclinicalbench.com on its own.
# Do the apex/www redirect in the dashboard instead:
#   Cloudflare > your domain > Rules > Redirect Rules > Create
#   If hostname equals www.theclinicalbench.com
#   Then dynamic redirect 301 to
#   concat("https://theclinicalbench.com", http.request.uri.path)
#   with "preserve query string" enabled.
#
# Path-level redirects go below, one per line:
# /old-path  /new-path  301
